  "query_preview": "forecast periods.  While the overall dry air mass will \nremain across the region through the week, temperatures will \nsteadily warm each day.  These increasing temperatures in this dry \nair mass causing afternoon minimum relative humidity values to fall \nto critically low values, coupled with the extremely dry soil \nconditions across the area, are expected to again promote dangerous \nfire conditions across the forecast area through much of the work \nweek. Please continue to monitor the latest forecast and outlook, as \nappropriate fire weather hazards/products will likely be needed and \nissued for portions of and eventually all of the forecast area \nduring this timeframe, particularly Tuesday through Friday. /19/",
